<title>PHILIPPINES: First Philippine to buy stake in power firm.</title>
<headline>First Philippine to buy stake in power firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Philippine Holdings Corp (FPHC) said on Friday it will acquire a 30 percent interest in Panay Electric Co for 459 million pesos.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange, FPHC said it will formalize the deal in October.</p>
<p>Panay Electric Co, a local unlisted firm, holds the franchise to supply electricity in Iloilo city, central Philippines.</p>
<p>FPHC has interests in power generation and infrastructure building.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
